"description": "EVN AG engages in the provision of electricity and natural gas utility services. It operates through Energy, Generation, Networks, South East Europe, Environment, and All Other segments. The Energy segment deals with the procurement of electricity, natural gas, and energy carriers. The Generation segment offers electricity generation from thermal sources and renewable energy. The Networks segment involves the operation of distribution networks and network infrastructure for electricity and natural gas. The South East Europe segment generates electricity from hydropower and distributes electricity to end customers in Bulgaria and Macedonia. The Environment segment includes drinking water supplies, wastewater disposal, and thermal waste incineration services. The All Other segment provides corporate services. The company was founded in 1922 and is headquartered in Maria Enzersdorf, Austria.",
